    {
      "tweet_id": "2096340163324711064",
      "blogger_id": "balder",
      "date": "2026-09-05",
      "created_at": "2026-09-05T16:50:17-04:00",
      "stance": "neutral",
      "mention_type": "explicit_stance",
      "reasons": [
        "Tether acquired 50.3% controlling stake per SEC 13D filing",
        "Rumble has its own independent data center (Rumble Cloud)",
        "Tether funded by offshore USD treasury interest income (~$10B/year on $100B+ in US treasuries)",
        "offshore capital moving into physical data infrastructure",
        "unclear how Tether + Rumble combination plays out strategically"
      ],
      "is_risk": false,
      "conviction": null,
      "raw_mention": "$RUM",
      "text": "今天 SEC 刚出来的 13D 文件，Tether 拿下了 Rumble 50.3% 的绝对控股权。\n\n之前传并购也就是听个八卦，不过过了 50.3% 这个比例感觉就不太一样了。现在 10 年期美债在 4.8%，Tether 拿着一千多亿美债，一年光无风险利息也能收上百亿美元。这基本就是台美联储管不到的印钞机，现在人家直接拿这些利息的钱下场，买了个自带独立数据中心（Rumble Cloud）的平台。\n\n平时大家都在算 AWS 和微软的份额。离岸资本现在已经跑去买物理机房了。这两种东西搭在一起以后具体是个什么玩法，我其实也还没太想明白。 $RUM",
